    "text": "etvnews.com\nwebsite\nHuntington\nChall and Annette Cook Named Huntington Heritage Days 2025 Grand Marshal\n13 hours ago\nChall and Annette Cook have been named the Grand Marshals for Huntington’s 2025 Heritage Days Parade. Chall has been a Huntington resident his whole life, apart from his missions, college and military service. His grandfather Johnson was one of the first Huntington settlers. Annette was raised in Ferron and Price.",
